# Files excluded from the published package.
#
# IMPORTANT: this file *replaces* .gitignore for publishing — pub only falls
# back to .gitignore when no .pubignore exists. Everything .gitignore excludes
# therefore has to be repeated here, or build output lands in the archive.
#
# Without this file, v1.3.0 shipped docs/superpowers/ (internal planning and
# design notes) to pub.dev: those are tracked in git, so .gitignore never
# excluded them.

# --- Internal planning, design and session notes -------------------------
docs/superpowers/
.superpowers/
.claude/

# --- Build output and local tooling state (mirrors .gitignore) -----------
/build/
/coverage/
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
/pubspec.lock
**/doc/api/
migrate_working_dir/

# --- Editor and OS cruft (mirrors .gitignore) ----------------------------
.idea/
.atom/
.buildlog/
.history
.svn/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.DS_Store
*.class
*.log
*.pyc
*.swp
